    detached

// ============================================================
// W03 Batch 13 : rootFreeSlotRaw moved here and wired to every W03 index
// Source: I6.2, I11-1 .. I11-7, I17.1, D02, D12
//
// Moved below rootSetDetachAllRaw only so that every detach helper it calls is
// defined first (Pine definition-before-use); the signature is unchanged.
// A free now releases the Root from every index it belongs to before the slot is
// reset, in this order:
//   1. lifecycle ownership (Root ID index, rootLiveSlots, rootIdOrderSlots)
//   2. read-only preflight of every non-participation index, including the entry
//      each swap-pop / shift would move: general Category / TF / state sets,
//      origin bucket, the common price order (point Roots) or the NativeRange
//      orders (FVG), the Accum pair side (Accum), the FVG non-price sets (FVG)
//   3. participation detach-all (all-or-nothing; false = nothing mutated)
//   4. origin -> price index -> Category-specific -> general sets, each already
//      proven by step 2, then the existing lifecycle detach / reset / free stack
// A Root is reset only after it has left every index. No rollback, no repair and
// no runtime.error; an inconsistency anywhere returns false with zero mutation.
// A non-FVG Root must hold no FVG position, an FVG Root no common price-order
// position. An FVG is freeable only while ACTIVE or INVALIDATED: W03 defines no
// Inverse or Retired FVG free. No revision is written, and W03 has no call site.
// ============================================================

// Moves one currently Live physical Root slot back to the free state.
// Returns true only when the slot was freed. An invalid slot, a non-live slot, a
// lifecycle collection that does not hold the slot, or any index membership that
// is not exactly consistent returns false with no mutation: this raw helper never
// repairs an inconsistent state by itself and never raises runtime.error.
rootFreeSlotRaw(ZoneEngine engine, int rootSlot) =>
    // Step 1 : validity
    bool validSlot = rootSlot >= 0 and rootSlot < array.size(engine.rootIds)
    bool isLive    = validSlot and array.get(engine.rootSlotLiveFlags, rootSlot)
    // W02 Batch 4 Step A : the Root ID owning this slot, read before any mutation.
    int  oldRootId = isLive ? array.get(engine.rootIds, rootSlot) : ID_NONE
    // W02 Batch 4 Step B : the I11-1 index must already agree with this slot.
    bool idIndexValid = isLive and oldRootId != ID_NONE and map.contains(engine.rootIdToSlot, oldRootId) and map.get(engine.rootIdToSlot, oldRootId) == rootSlot
    bool freed     = false
    if isLive
        // Step 2 : position inside rootLiveSlots. The index always advances.
        int livePos = SLOT_INVALID
        int i = 0
        while i < array.size(engine.rootLiveSlots) and livePos == SLOT_INVALID
